# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
FACTORY_DEF {*} TeeFactory    FACTORY_NAME { Junction_96 }    INPUT  FEATURE_TYPE ListRenamer_OUTPUT    INPUT  FEATURE_TYPE Junction_97_Output    INPUT  FEATURE_TYPE Tester_14_FAILED    OUTPUT { FEATURE_TYPE Junction_96_Output         }
